  "title": "Count the Digits",
  "description": "Given a non-negative integer n, return how many digits it has when written in base 10. Watch the number shrink one digit at a time as you divide it by 10.",
  "constraints": [
   "0 <= n <= 10^9",
   "0 has one digit."
